    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyberpunk Horror</h2><br>You stopped at a cyberpunk hotel and late in the evening decided to do some laundry, but then the power went out throughout the entire hotel.<br>After that, strange things start to happen.<br>The administration sends an master, but he behaves inappropriately.<br><br>It's a first-person horror game with standard controls: keyboard and mouse. <br>Here you need to run away, hide and look for keys in a dark hotel in order to get back to your room.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Cyberpunk atmosphere.<br></li><li> Unique decoration.<br></li><li> Simple and pleasant controls.<br></li><li> Beautiful Unreal Engine 5 graphics.<br></li><li> Good optimization.</li></ul>",
